    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YANCY is an NES style action adventure that follows a small protagonist in a vast world full of dangerous foes, magical swords and incredible rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve your own path through a non-linear game world, exploring hand-crafted dungeons, forging  legendary weapons and battling challenging bosses, in a quest to uncover the world's best kept secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f AN 'ACTUALLY' OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YANCY is fully non-linear. Take the road less travelled, or the path of least resistance. Die a thousand times to a boss you obviously aren't prepared for. No matter what, you're trusted with the reigns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/439fd6854ac447b4112f70241ea418ca.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/439fd6854ac447b4112f70241ea418ca.webm?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/439fd6854ac447b4112f70241ea418ca.mp4?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f MAGICAL SWORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge an arsenal of powerful weapons from the materials you find adventuring. Build swords of Oak, Iron and Soul. Swords that shoot lightning, conjure meteor showers, or summon wolves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/6461517d43233a71432986ef99c948e6.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/6461517d43233a71432986ef99c948e6.webm?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/6461517d43233a71432986ef99c948e6.mp4?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 RETRO SPIRIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is perilous, and the puzzles obtuse. You'll need both a quick hand and sharp wits to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/07f24e2e759346d8c808f18cf4c20847.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/07f24e2e759346d8c808f18cf4c20847.webm?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/07f24e2e759346d8c808f18cf4c20847.mp4?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd0e ANCIENT MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Centuries of history lie hidden in the unclaimed country. Search farther, dig deeper, and overcome impossible odds to unearth the world's best kept secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/d3d86d5cd7db40f782671c42280568e4.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/d3d86d5cd7db40f782671c42280568e4.apng?t=1748075456\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YANCY is an NES style action adventure that follows a small protagonist in a vast world full of dangerous foes, magical swords and incredible rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve your own path through a non-linear game world, exploring hand-crafted dungeons, forging  legendary weapons and battling challenging bosses, in a quest to uncover the world's best kept secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f AN 'ACTUALLY' OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YANCY is fully non-linear. Take the road less travelled, or the path of least resistance. Die a thousand times to a boss you obviously aren't prepared for. No matter what, you're trusted with the reigns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/439fd6854ac447b4112f70241ea418ca.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/439fd6854ac447b4112f70241ea418ca.webm?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/439fd6854ac447b4112f70241ea418ca.mp4?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f MAGICAL SWORDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge an arsenal of powerful weapons from the materials you find adventuring. Build swords of Oak, Iron and Soul. Swords that shoot lightning, conjure meteor showers, or summon wolves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/6461517d43233a71432986ef99c948e6.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/6461517d43233a71432986ef99c948e6.webm?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/6461517d43233a71432986ef99c948e6.mp4?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 RETRO SPIRIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is perilous, and the puzzles obtuse. You'll need both a quick hand and sharp wits to snatch victory from the jaws of defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/07f24e2e759346d8c808f18cf4c20847.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/07f24e2e759346d8c808f18cf4c20847.webm?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/07f24e2e759346d8c808f18cf4c20847.mp4?t=1748075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd0e ANCIENT MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Centuries of history lie hidden in the unclaimed country. Search farther, dig deeper, and overcome impossible odds to unearth the world's best kept secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/d3d86d5cd7db40f782671c42280568e4.poster.avif?t=1748075456\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1208630/extras/d3d86d5cd7db40f782671c42280568e4.apng?t=1748075456\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
